069,"digest":"sha256:ed2c86583cca6fdbb9baaeaa2f135a10f7a74092b6200e0d604738b22c6bd52f","download_count":207,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:26:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T09:26:05Z"},{"id":694938859,"node_id":"RA_kwDOEuFCls4pa-zr","name":"jreleaser-tool-provider-1.27.0.jar.asc","label":"","uploader":{"login":"aalmiray","id":13969,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTY5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain","state":"uploaded","size":821,"digest":"sha256:85c09fbb6c2c228b877f4948065812cc0ddd7b877d75eec3669eb95710dc9146","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:26:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T09:26:06Z"},{"id":694936176,"node_id":"RA_kwDOEuFCls4pa-Jw","name":"VERSION","label":"","uploader":{"login":"aalmiray","id":13969,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTY5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain","state":"uploaded","size":7,"digest":"sha256:7ef1ea58fece676ff7345f6edac427e671daf20f0d7499ef2e42ada241d4fe24","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:24:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T09:24:47Z"}],"body":"## Binaries\n\n[https://github.com/jreleaser/jreleaser/wiki/Release-v1.27.0](https://github.com/jreleaser/jreleaser/wiki/Release-v1.27.0)\n\n## Changelog\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n**build**\n- e246558 Add more details to module descriptor in jreleaser-tool-provider, closes #2175\n\n**changelog**\n- 742a5bc Constraint issue number matching regex, closes #2172\n\n**core**\n- 3301e9b Resolve recursive templates, closes #2159 #2177\n- 4d83050 Use sourced properties to resolve DSL vars, closes #2176\n\n**deploy**\n- 99949be Parse POMs without XPath so native-image works\n\n**release**\n- 710ab6b Set the git remote to JRELEASER_DEFAULT_GIT_REMOTE, closes #2170\n\n**sftp**\n- c26e24c create parent dirs with SFTPClient\n\n## 🛠  Build\n\n- bc616c5 Update release announcements\n- a87a9c2 Update GH workflows\n- 75e29dd Minimize javadoc JAR when running on Java 23+\n\n## 📝 Documentation\n\n- e482e2f Add latmc as a contributor for code\n- 39cce66 Add Adito5393 as a contributor for code\n\n## ⚙️  Dependencies\n\n- be798d3 Update zstd-jni to 1.5.7-25\n- 3bc8c96 Update stax2-api to 4.3.2\n- 4da2336 Update woodstox to 7.3.0\n- 57eedd0 Update syft to 1.55.0\n- 2e63db8 Update sshj to 0.41.2\n- 5333b42 Update spotbugs to 4.10.5\n- 5a9c25f Update snakeyaml to 2.7\n- c06fff2 Update slf4j to 2.0.20\n- 4e3a742 Update plexus-archiver to 4.15.0\n- a444c8c Update plexus-utils to 4.1.0\n- a3e1d51 Update mockito to 5.24.0\n- df9a511 Update jsoup to 1.23.2\n- 01008b1 Update jacoco to 0.8.16\n- 36cf179 Update httpcore5 to 5.4.4\n- 0e41de7 Update httpclient5 to 5.6.5\n- 2cb02eb Update greenmail to 2.1.15\n- c0af215 Update feign to 13.17\n- 84509fd Update cosign to 3.1.4\n- 5ee33db Update commons-lang3 to 3.20.1\n- ed2da15 Update commons-jexl to 3.7.1\n- 6803674 Update commons-codec to 1.23.0\n- a0d2443 Update classmate to 1.8.0\n- c9973d6 Update checkstyle to 14.3.0\n- b348956 Update errorprone to 2.50.0\n- c93c5ff Update checker-qual to 3.55.1\n- ce38dd9 Update byte-buddy to 1.18.16\n- bace1f3 Update bouncycastle to 1.86\n- a34b906 Update aws-java-sdk to 2.57.5\n- 0452d30 Update ant to 1.10.18\n- f875c37 Update jakarta-activation to 2.1.4\n\n---\n- 5c0aa95 Releasing version 1.27.0\n- f7d5497 Bump for next development cycle\n\n\n## Contributors\nWe'd like to thank the following people for their contributions:\n- Adi ([@Adito5393](https://github.com/Adito5393))\n- Andres Almiray ([@aalmiray](https://github.com/aalmiray))\n- TATSUNO “Taz” Yasuhiro\n- latmc"}
